WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.267 --> 00:00:02.434
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:02.434 --> 00:00:06.701
♪♪

00:00:06.701 --> 00:00:08.834
-You've never acted...
-No.

00:00:08.834 --> 00:00:10.000
-No.
-You felt it.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:11.801
-And you've actually asked to
not act with me.

00:00:11.801 --> 00:00:13.634
-We have acted.

00:00:13.634 --> 00:00:15.901
We did that thing with the --
[ Mimicking instrument ]

00:00:15.901 --> 00:00:17.834
In the nest.
We've [bleep] done it.

00:00:17.834 --> 00:00:19.300
-[ Laughing ]

00:00:19.300 --> 00:00:21.567
-Do you remember that?
-That's some of my best work.

00:00:21.567 --> 00:00:22.634
-You were...

00:00:22.634 --> 00:00:23.901
-I had a little hat on
or something.

00:00:23.901 --> 00:00:26.167
-Yeah, you were like,
you were in a bird's nest.

00:00:26.167 --> 00:00:28.601
-We've acted.
-[ Laughing ]

00:00:28.601 --> 00:00:30.234
-We have acted.
-Do you remember that?

00:00:30.234 --> 00:00:31.334
-Yeah.
-Oh, my God.

00:00:31.334 --> 00:00:32.767
-That was a classic.
-That was.

00:00:32.767 --> 00:00:35.267
-That, I have to say, I have
looked that up now and again,

00:00:35.267 --> 00:00:36.734
just to cheer myself up,
'cause that was...

00:00:36.734 --> 00:00:38.234
-That was out there.
-That was.

00:00:38.234 --> 00:00:39.734
-Oh, I was Goat Leg Greg.

00:00:39.734 --> 00:00:41.000
-Goat Leg Greg!

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:43.000
-Yeah, we did it once.
We did it once.

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:44.434
[ Both laugh ]

00:00:44.434 --> 00:00:48.400
I was a man with goat legs
and I would tell riddles.

00:00:48.400 --> 00:00:49.501
-Yeah.
-And then you were

00:00:49.501 --> 00:00:51.200
Gilvin of the Tree.

00:00:51.200 --> 00:00:52.968
[ Both laugh ]
-It's all coming back to you.

00:00:52.968 --> 00:00:54.167
-Yes.
-Gilvin of the Tree.

00:00:54.167 --> 00:00:55.200
-You were Gilvin of the Tree.
-That's right.

00:00:55.200 --> 00:00:57.033
-And we had special teeth
made for you.

00:00:57.033 --> 00:00:58.567
-And they kept falling out
all the time.

00:00:58.567 --> 00:01:00.100
♪♪

00:01:00.100 --> 00:01:01.601
-And this is...

00:01:01.601 --> 00:01:04.234
Pearls of Wisdom
with Goat Leg Greg.

00:01:04.234 --> 00:01:05.601
[ Laughing ]

00:01:05.601 --> 00:01:08.467
Gilvin of the Tree,
show yourself!

00:01:08.467 --> 00:01:10.634
-It's Gilvin of the Tree.

00:01:10.634 --> 00:01:13.367
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:13.367 --> 00:01:17.267
[ Playing recorder ]

00:01:17.267 --> 00:01:19.767
Commence thy pearls, Greg.

00:01:19.767 --> 00:01:21.267
[ Muffled words ]

00:01:21.267 --> 00:01:22.701
[ Laughter ]

00:01:22.701 --> 00:01:24.601
..."American Idol."

00:01:24.601 --> 00:01:26.834
[ Laughter ]

00:01:26.834 --> 00:01:28.434
-What in the...

00:01:28.434 --> 00:01:30.300
That was one of the weirdest
sketches we ever did.

